cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MHEEF or its data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "MHEEF — Mapping High Energy Experimental Facilities"
abstract: >-
  An atlas of high-energy physics facilities — accelerator and underground
  laboratories, neutrino, cosmic-ray and gamma-ray observatories,
  gravitational-wave detectors and nuclear physics facilities — with their
  history, experiments, key results and people. Every entry cites the source
  it was checked against.
authors:
  - family-names: Dash
    given-names: Prayog
url: "https://prayog-09.github.io/mheef/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Prayog-09/mheef"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - high-energy physics
  - particle physics
  - research infrastructure
  - atlas
